        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0009",
          "participant_id": "participantid-marcus",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:35:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:35:00Z",
          "text": "Plus one.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0010",
          "participant_id": "participantid-priya",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:35:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:36:00Z",
          "text": "Good. Decision: Lyra and Spring Health move to RFP, Modern Health is out. Dana, can you draft the RFP doc this week and share it for review by Monday?",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0011",
          "participant_id": "participantid-dana",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:36:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:36:00Z",
          "text": "Will do. I'll have it in the shared drive by end of day Friday.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0012",
          "participant_id": "participantid-priya",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:36:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:37:00Z",
          "text": "Perfect. Item two — pilot cohort. I want to land on a number today. Marcus, what's your read?",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0013",
          "participant_id": "participantid-marcus",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:37:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:38:00Z",
          "text": "I've been going back and forth. Anything under 100 people and we won't have enough signal to evaluate; anything over 200 and we're basically launching, not piloting. I'd land at 120. Big enough to see real utilization patterns, small enough that if something is off with the vendor we can pull the plug without it being company-wide.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0014",
          "participant_id": "participantid-dana",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:38:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:39:00Z",
          "text": "I'd second 120. And on cohort selection — I'd suggest we pull from clinical-ops and the call-center org. Two reasons: those are our two highest-burnout populations per the engagement survey, so utilization signal will be clearest there, and they're both sized such that 120 employees splits cleanly without forcing us to mix three orgs.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0015",
          "participant_id": "participantid-priya",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:39:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:39:00Z",
          "text": "That works for me. Any concern about selection bias if we only pull from those two orgs?",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0016",
          "participant_id": "participantid-marcus",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:39:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:40:00Z",
          "text": "Some, but I think the trade-off is worth it for the pilot. We can broaden in the full launch.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0017",
          "participant_id": "participantid-priya",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:40:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:40:00Z",
          "text": "Okay. Decision: 120-person pilot, drawn from clinical-ops and call-center, with a 4-week intake window so people can opt in on their own schedule. Marcus, you'll own the intake comms?",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0018",
          "participant_id": "participantid-marcus",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:40:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:41:00Z",
          "text": "Yep.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0019",
          "participant_id": "participantid-priya",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:41:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:41:00Z",
          "text": "Good. Item three — Q3 budget. Tomas confirmed the $185k cap last week. Dana, how do we want to slice it?",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0020",
          "participant_id": "participantid-dana",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:41:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:43:00Z",
          "text": "I'd carve out $30k for vendor demos and onboarding, $20k for internal comms — videos, intranet, manager toolkit — and hold the remaining $135k as the actual program spend, which at 120 pilot employees and a roughly $14 PEPM blended rate gets us comfortably through Q3 and Q4 with margin for the full launch ramp.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0021",
          "participant_id": "participantid-marcus",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:43:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:43:00Z",
          "text": "That math works. I'd just flag that the $20k comms number assumes we don't end up needing to bring in an external vendor for the launch video — if we do, that goes up.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0022",
          "participant_id": "participantid-priya",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:43:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:44:00Z",
          "text": "Noted. We can revisit if the in-house team can't turn it around. Decision: Q3 envelope is $185k, with $30k vendor demos, $20k comms, $135k program. Marcus, please reflect that in the budget tracker today.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0023",
          "participant_id": "participantid-marcus",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:44:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:44:00Z",
          "text": "On it.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0024",
          "participant_id": "participantid-priya",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:44:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:45:00Z",
          "text": "Last item — kickoff timeline. I want to be thoughtful here, because if we announce too early we create anxiety about who's in the pilot and who isn't, and if we announce too late people feel blindsided. Where do we land?",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0025",
          "participant_id": "participantid-dana",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:45:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:46:00Z",
          "text": "My proposal is a Jul 8 internal announcement to managers — full briefing pack, FAQ, talking points — and then a Jul 22 employee-facing launch. That gives managers two weeks to be the trusted first source if employees ask questions.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0026",
          "participant_id": "participantid-marcus",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:46:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:46:00Z",
          "text": "I like that. The two-week manager-first window has worked well for us on the last two rollouts.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0027",
          "participant_id": "participantid-priya",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:46:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:47:00Z",
          "text": "Agreed. Decision: Jul 8 manager briefing, Jul 22 employee-facing launch. Dana, you'll own the manager briefing pack?",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0028",
          "participant_id": "participantid-dana",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:47:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:47:00Z",
          "text": "Yes.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0029",
          "participant_id": "participantid-priya",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:47:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:48:00Z",
          "text": "And Marcus, you'll own the employee-facing launch comms in coordination with Aisha on the recruiting side, since some of this overlaps with the candidate-experience messaging?",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0030",
          "participant_id": "participantid-marcus",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:48:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:48:00Z",
          "text": "Yep, I'll loop Aisha in this week.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0031",
          "participant_id": "participantid-priya",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:48:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:50:00Z",
          "text": "Perfect. Quick sanity check on action items — Dana: RFP draft by Friday, manager briefing pack owner. Marcus: pilot intake comms, budget tracker update today, employee-facing launch comms with Aisha. Me: I'll update Tomas on the vendor decision and the timeline. Anything I'm missing?",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0032",
          "participant_id": "participantid-dana",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:50:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:50:00Z",
          "text": "I think that covers it.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0033",
          "participant_id": "participantid-marcus",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:50:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:51:00Z",
          "text": "One thing — do we want to set a formal check-in cadence between now and Jul 8? I'd suggest weekly for the next three weeks given how much we have to land.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0034",
          "participant_id": "participantid-priya",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:51:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:51:00Z",
          "text": "Good call. Same time next Wednesday, and I'll keep this slot held through Jul 1.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0035",
          "participant_id": "participantid-marcus",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:51:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:51:00Z",
          "text": "Works.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0036",
          "participant_id": "participantid-dana",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:51:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:52:00Z",
          "text": "Works.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0037",
          "participant_id": "participantid-priya",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:52:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:53:00Z",
          "text": "One more thing while I have you both — on the program scope itself, are we still aligned that Phase 1 is the EAP and clinician-access piece, and Phase 2 is the manager-training and burnout-prevention curriculum? I don't want us to scope-creep into Phase 2 during the pilot.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0038",
          "participant_id": "participantid-dana",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:53:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:53:00Z",
          "text": "Aligned. Phase 1 only for the pilot. The manager curriculum is Q4 at the earliest.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0039",
          "participant_id": "participantid-marcus",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:53:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:54:00Z",
          "text": "Same.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0040",
          "participant_id": "participantid-priya",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:54:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:55:00Z",
          "text": "Great. And on metrics — utilization rate, NPS from pilot participants, and a 90-day clinical-engagement signal from Lyra/Spring's reporting. Anything else you want to track?",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0041",
          "participant_id": "participantid-dana",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:55:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:55:00Z",
          "text": "I'd add a manager-experience survey at day 60 — just three questions, did your direct reports raise it, did you feel equipped to talk about it, did you refer anyone in.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0042",
          "participant_id": "participantid-marcus",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:55:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:56:00Z",
          "text": "Plus one on that. Cheap signal, useful.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0043",
          "participant_id": "participantid-priya",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:56:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:56:00Z",
          "text": "Added. So metrics: utilization, participant NPS, 90-day clinical engagement, day-60 manager survey. Dana, please add those to the program brief.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0044",
          "participant_id": "participantid-dana",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:56:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:57:00Z",
          "text": "Will do.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0045",
          "participant_id": "participantid-priya",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:57:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:57:00Z",
          "text": "Okay — anything else for either of you before I let you go?",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0046",
          "participant_id": "participantid-marcus",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:57:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:57:00Z",
          "text": "Nothing from me.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0047",
          "participant_id": "participantid-dana",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:57:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:58:00Z",
          "text": "Nothing here.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0048",
          "participant_id": "participantid-priya",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:58:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:58:00Z",
          "text": "Okay, I think that's everything on my list — let's wrap here. Thanks everyone for staying focused.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0049",
          "participant_id": "participantid-marcus",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:58:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:58:00Z",
          "text": "Thanks Priya — good session.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0050",
          "participant_id": "participantid-dana",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:58:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:59:00Z",
          "text": "Yeah, productive. Talk soon!",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0051",
          "participant_id": "participantid-priya",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:59:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:59:06Z",
          "text": "Alright, I've got to jump to my 11 — talk soon.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0052",
          "participant_id": "participantid-marcus",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:59:06Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:59:22Z",
          "text": "Did you see facilities took over Cedar for the rest of the week? I had my Thursday one-on-one booked in there.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0053",
          "participant_id": "participantid-dana",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:59:22Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T10:59:44Z",
          "text": "Yeah, they posted it this morning. Something about the HVAC. I shifted mine to Birch.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0054",
          "participant_id": "participantid-marcus",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T10:59:44Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:00:06Z",
          "text": "You going to the Friday all-hands? I heard they're walking through the Q2 numbers live this time.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0055",
          "participant_id": "participantid-dana",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:00:06Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:00:28Z",
          "text": "I'll be there. Last month they ran long, so I blocked the hour after just in case.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0056",
          "participant_id": "participantid-marcus",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:00:28Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:00:50Z",
          "text": "Have you tried the new expense tool yet? I submitted one receipt and it made me recategorize it twice.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0057",
          "participant_id": "participantid-dana",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:00:50Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:01:12Z",
          "text": "Same thing happened to me. I asked finance to walk me through it. The old codes don't carry over.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0058",
          "participant_id": "participantid-marcus",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:01:12Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:01:34Z",
          "text": "And the coffee machine on three is out again. I stood there a full minute before I noticed the tag.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0059",
          "participant_id": "participantid-dana",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:01:34Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:01:56Z",
          "text": "That's the second time this month. I've started bringing a thermos.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0060",
          "participant_id": "participantid-marcus",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:01:56Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:02:28Z",
          "text": "Anyway. That reorg note from last month is still sitting in my inbox. I keep meaning to open the org chart they attached.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0061",
          "participant_id": "participantid-dana",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:02:28Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:03:00Z",
          "text": "I skimmed it. A couple of teams moved under clinical-ops. A lot of names to keep straight.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0062",
          "participant_id": "participantid-marcus",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:03:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:04:00Z",
          "text": "God, I'm wiped. Honestly all this wellbeing-program talk is hitting close to home this week — I've been lying awake at 3 AM most nights and can't get back down.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0063",
          "participant_id": "participantid-marcus",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:04:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:04:00Z",
          "text": "It's funny, I keep thinking I should have figured out the off-switch by now — I've been doing this job almost twelve years and I still can't make my head shut up at night.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0064",
          "participant_id": "participantid-dana",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:04:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:05:00Z",
          "text": "Oof. That sounds rough. How long has it been like this?",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0065",
          "participant_id": "participantid-marcus",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:05:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:05:00Z",
          "text": "Maybe six weeks? It started around the reorg announcement and it just hasn't let up. I keep telling myself it'll settle.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0066",
          "participant_id": "participantid-dana",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:05:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:06:00Z",
          "text": "Oh same, honestly. The toddler is in a sleep-regression phase so I'm just running on coffee. Some days I wonder how long I can keep doing this without hitting a wall.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0067",
          "participant_id": "participantid-marcus",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:06:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:06:00Z",
          "text": "Yeah. Honestly, between you and me, I think we should pull the manager-training and burnout curriculum forward into Phase 1 — Phase 2 is too late, people are struggling now. I might push back on Priya about the sequencing.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0068",
          "participant_id": "participantid-dana",
          "start_time": "2026-04-29T11:06:00Z",
          "end_time": "2026-04-29T11:06:00Z",
          "text": "I've been thinking the same. And I'd add a sleep-hygiene workshop to the program — something practical, not just clinician-access. Half the people I know in the building are running on four hours.",
          "language": "en",
          "final": true
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "segmentid-0069",
          "participant_id": "participantid-marcus",
